OL,5,Ascour wreckage
OL,6,
OL,7,FFootage - which you can see at the top
OL,8,Fof this page - shows firefighters
OL,9,Fpulling one survivor out of the debris
OL,10,Fon a stretcher
OL,12,FAn investigation is under way to
OL,13,Festablish what caused the building,
OL,14,Fwhich contained apartments, to suddenly
OL,15,Fcollapse - this map shows where it is
